Subject: Ask lxml to resolve external entities when reading the manual pages

lxml's XMLParser() defaults to resolve_entities='internal', which leaves the
external parameter entity custom-entities.ent unloaded, so
make-directive-index.py and make-man-index.py stop at the first page using it
with "Entity 'entities' not defined".

--- a/tools/xml_helper.py
+++ b/tools/xml_helper.py
@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@
 
         return None
 
-_parser = tree.XMLParser()
+_parser = tree.XMLParser(resolve_entities=True)
 # pylint: disable=no-member
 _parser.resolvers.add(CustomResolver())
 
